{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Alchemortis</i> is a dark fantasy roguelite autobattler where alchemy is used to recombine and alter your builds. Collect cards, alchemize them, and uncover powerful new synergies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vanquish Your Foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cards and deploy their abilities by strategically placing them within your inventory. Discover synergies, refine your build, and watch the battles play out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/94a1b9f19f9ddb1e9ec7afc31262cd64.poster.avif?t=1769214243\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/94a1b9f19f9ddb1e9ec7afc31262cd64.webm?t=1769214243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/94a1b9f19f9ddb1e9ec7afc31262cd64.mp4?t=1769214243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create Your Own Builds with Alchemy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the abilities of multiple cards into a single creation. Use alchemy to forge new synergies and shape unique builds. Leverage alchemical reagents to further refine your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/269ff532fc6552746423be33b8c8f894.poster.avif?t=1769214243\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/269ff532fc6552746423be33b8c8f894.webm?t=1769214243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/269ff532fc6552746423be33b8c8f894.mp4?t=1769214243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traverse a Hostile World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a hostile world in search of power. Visit shops, uncover artifacts, and harvest alchemical reagents. But beware, the Inquisition is on the march.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/e1127b957c10b3254bede82ea76c45de.poster.avif?t=1769214243\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/e1127b957c10b3254bede82ea76c45de.webm?t=1769214243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/e1127b957c10b3254bede82ea76c45de.mp4?t=1769214243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become a Master Alchemist</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the tools at your disposal to craft a build capable of toppling the Inquisition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/a816f79d9cc8423f9b71bb28e336bf5b.poster.avif?t=1769214243\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/a816f79d9cc8423f9b71bb28e336bf5b.webm?t=1769214243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967230/extras/a816f79d9cc8423f9b71bb28e336bf5b.mp4?t=1769214243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967230?t=1769214243","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/sto